    "html": "<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.rivoligroup.com/careers/vacancies/pos-administrator\">\n<main>\n    \n<div class=\"page-wrap vacancies--detail\">\n    <section class=\"page-title-block  text-center fade-in border-b-light\" data-delay=\"0.1\">\n        <div class=\"container d-flex flex-direction-column justify-content-center align-items-center split-it\">\n            \n\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap \"><ul class=\"breadcrumb-list list-unstyled d-flex justify-content-center  align-items-center\"><li><a class=\"text-uppercase l-sp-2\" href=\"https://www.rivoligroup.com/\" target=\"_self\">Home</a></li><li class=\"sep\"> / </li><li><a class=\"text-uppercase l-sp-2\" href=\"https://www.rivoligroup.com/careers\" target=\"_self\">Careers</a></li><li class=\"sep\"> / </li><li><a class=\"text-uppercase l-sp-2\" href=\"https://www.rivoligroup.com/careers/vacancies\" target=\"_self\">Vacancies</a></li><li class=\"sep\"> / </li><li class=\"active text-uppercase l-sp-2\">POS Administrator</li></ul></div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-uppercase m-0 \"> POS Administrator</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <section class=\"content-block pa-y-100 fade-in\" >\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"d-flex  flex-wrap justify-content-between\">\n                    <div class=\"co-7\">\n                        <div class=\"default-text-block\">\n                            \n\n    <h3>The job</h3>\n\n<p>The POS Administrator is responsible for managing and supporting the Point of Sale (POS) system across all watch boutiques and retail outlets. The role ensures smooth billing operations, accurate pricing, promotions, customer service processes, and seamless integration with ERP systems.</p>\n\n<h3>Job Description</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Managing day-to-day POS operations across all boutiques and stores</li>\n\t<li>Managing data flow from POS to Head Office and from Head Office to POS through Data Directors</li>\n\t<li>Monitoring scheduled automated jobs running on the server and troubleshooting any issues</li>\n\t<li>Preparing and configuring POS systems for new store openings</li>\n\t<li>Ensuring compliance with brand standards, audit controls, and data security policies</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>PROFILE</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>3&ndash;5 years of hands-on experience in MS Dynamics NAV / LS Retail, preferably within the retail industry</li>\n\t<li>Excellent knowledge of LS Retail</li>\n\t<li>Excellent problem-solving skills</li>\n\t<li>Strong communication and interpersonal skills</li>\n\t<li>High level of multitasking with the ability to meet deadlines</li>\n\t<li>Strong customer service orientation and team focus</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                     <div class=\"co-4 pa-0\">\n                         \n\n    \n\n     \n\n     <div class=\"box-item d-flex justify-content-center flex-direction-column  type-three border-green\">\n                                    <div class=\"page-desc\">\n                                                                                    <h6 class=\"text-capitalize text-truncate two-line\"> Apply for this position</h6>\n                                                                                                                            \n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"button-wrap d-flex flex-wrap\">\n                                                                                                                            <a class=\"primary-btn green  fade-in open-next-popup\"  >apply now                                                <div class=\"lines\"><span class=\"b-line\"></span><span class=\"s-line\"></span></div>\n                                            </a>\n                                                                            </div>\n                        </div> \n\n        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    \n     \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n\n        <div class=\"form-popup\">\n        <div class=\"overlay close-popup\"></div>\n        <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div class=\"close-btn close-popup position-absolute\">\n                <img src=\"/application/themes/rivoli/assets/images/icons/close.svg\" alt=\"\" />\n            </div>\n            \n\n    <h6>Apply Now</h6>\n\n<p>Submit your Job Application</p>\n\n\n\n    \n<div class=\"formidable\" id=\"formidable_2015\">\n\n    \n        <div id=\"formidable_career_form\" class=\"\">\n\n                        <div class=\"alert alert-danger hide\" data-formidable-message>\n            </div>\n\n                        <form action=\"https://www.rivoligroup.com/formidable/dialog/formidable\" method=\"post\" class=\"needs-validation\" novalidate enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" data-form-handle=\"formidable_career_form\">\n\n                                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"formID\" name=\"formID\" value=\"2\" />                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"ccm_token\" name=\"ccm_token\" value=\"1790181209:b4b40985fca1cc10a8d6294ac5141961\" />                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"bID\" name=\"bID\" value=\"2015\" />                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"cID\" name=\"cID\" value=\"20206\" />                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"action\" name=\"action\" value=\"submit\" />                <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"g-recaptcha-response\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" />\n                                \n                                        <div class=\"row \">\n                    \n                                                <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-12 \">\n                        \n                                                        <div class=\"form-group\" data-formidable-type=\"hidden\" data-formidable-handle=\"job_title\">\n                                                        \n               